            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Request for Qualifications (RFQ) for Economic Analysis and Final Report for the Black Coloradan Racial Equity Study Commission. <a href="https://content.leg.colorado.gov/sites/default/files/2026-10/Request%20for%20Qualifications%20%28RFQ%29%20for%20Economic%20Analysis%20and%20Final%20Report%20for%20the%20Black%20Coloradan%20Racial%20Equity%20Study%20Commission%20Memorandum.pdf">Read more.</a><p>
<p>&nbsp;</p><p>We are currently migrating legacy session data to a new location. Links to said data may not be functional at this time. <a href="https://content.leg.colorado.gov/archiving-legacy-legislative-pages">Read More</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://leg.colorado.gov/bluebook">2026 Ballot Information Booklet (Blue Book)</a></p>

